       TraderKindDefs if that mod is ever reactivated, AND/OR mandrake.rsw.armoury's
       own already-absorbed copy that is live today (see NEW FINDING above) - a
       defName-keyed xpath against the merged Defs document hits both without
       needing to know which one is present. Content-matched (pawnKindDefs/li=...)
       rather than list position, per the item file's own guidance, since each
       trader def has two structurally-identical stockGenerators/li entries. -->

  <!-- Site 7: orbital trader, common droids (KotORDroidColonist_DevWD/SentWD) -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods><li>ABF: Artificial Beings Framework</li></mods>
    <nomatch Class="PatchOperationRemove">
      <xpath>/Defs/TraderKindDef[defName="guy762_TraderKind_baragwin"]/stockGenerators/li[@Class="ArtificialBeings.StockGenerator_Colonists"][pawnKindDefs/li="KotORDroidColonist_DevWD"]</xpath>
    </nomatch>
  </Operation>

  <!-- Site 8: orbital trader, uncommon droids (KotORDroidColonist_ADMkI/ADMkIV) -->
